; Probe for tests/tools/Record16MenuGolden.py: EasyUO 1.6 MENU golden values.
; "menu reforge mode 1.6" makes Reforged run it under the 1.6 logic; 1.6 ignores the line.
; A sub that builds a form called twice: the second "menu form pop" is a
; duplicate, so only the first popup is ever shown.
;@wait A
;@forms
menu reforge mode 1.6
gosub popup 100 100 First_message
wait 5
gosub popup 450 100 Second_message
menu getprop msg text
set %r MSG= , #menures
menu getprop pop left
set %r %r , _POPL= , #menures
menu window title R:A: , %r
wait 40
halt
sub popup
  menu form pop %1 %2 300 80 Popup
  menu text msg 10 10 %3
  menu button ok 10 40 60 20 OK
  menu setprop pop visible #true
return
